{"id":"63d78783676930ab","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Normal Space Witness","display":"df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness — ZFC Topo10 Normal Space Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness — ZFC Topo10 Normal Space Witness","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-topo10-regular-space-witness]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-normal-space-witness — ZFC Topo10 Normal Space Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference\">58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"56486a06b9ccfb62\" href=\"?note=56486a06b9ccfb62\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo10-regular-space-witness\">58-df-zfc-topo10-regular-space-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\">\\(X,\\tau\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> (closed-set candidates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> (open-set witnesses, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NormalSpaceWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NormalSpaceWitness}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}normal\\text{-}space\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NormalSpaceWitness}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;(F\\cap G=\\emptyset\\land X\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\land X\\setminus G\\in\\tau\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(F\\subseteq U\\land G\\subseteq V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}normal\\text{-}space\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NormalSpaceWitness}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;(F\\cap G=\\emptyset\\land X\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\land X\\setminus G\\in\\tau\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(F\\subseteq U\\land G\\subseteq V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary normality definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo10-regular-space-witness","status":"resolved","id":"56486a06b9ccfb62","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo10-regular-space-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen